# Force LF line endings on checkout for every OS.
#
# Several tests embed byte-exact wire-format fixtures via include_str!
# (e.g. crates/providers/tests/fixtures/*.sse). On a Windows runner with
# autocrlf, an LF blob is checked out as CRLF, so include_str! embeds the wrong
# bytes and the SSE/JSON parsers fail ("trailing characters"). Pinning LF keeps
# fixtures — and Rust sources, shell scripts, queries, and configs — identical
# across Linux, macOS, and Windows.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets git must never line-ending-convert.
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
